ssed\", \"coverage-review-act\"],\n  \"context\": \"session-2026-03-28\"\n})"},{"id":"blk-42612","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47522","text":"Always use "},{"id":"spn-47523","marks":["code"],"text":"transition_goal"},{"id":"spn-47524","text":" (not "},{"id":"spn-47525","marks":["code"],"text":"update_goal"},{"id":"spn-47526","text":") for status changes — provides audit trail. Include "},{"id":"spn-47527","marks":["code"],"text":"reason"},{"id":"spn-47528","text":" and evidence in metadata."}]},{"id":"blk-42613","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47529","text":"Set progress"}]},{"id":"blk-42614","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", goal_id: \"<id>\", progress: 0.6, metadata: {\n  \"basis\": \"3 of 5 sub-goals completed\"\n})"},{"id":"blk-42615","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47530","marks":["bold"],"text":"Progress benchmarks (base on evidence, not optimism):"}]},{"id":"blk-42616","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42618","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47531","text":"0.0 — not started"}]}],"id":"blk-42617","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42620","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47532","text":"0.1-0.3 — early exploration, initial nodes stored"}]}],"id":"blk-42619","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42622","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47533","text":"0.3-0.5 — core knowledge captured, key sub-goals active"}]}],"id":"blk-42621","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42624","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47534","text":"0.5-0.7 — substantial coverage, most sub-goals done"}]}],"id":"blk-42623","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42626","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47535","text":"0.7-0.9 — near complete, verifying/testing"}]}],"id":"blk-42625","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42628","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47536","text":"1.0 — all criteria met"}]}],"id":"blk-42627","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list",